        "product_summary": "Layered synthetic-leather upper: Overlapping toe, side and heel panels create a defined athletic casual profile.\n\nLace-up front: Eyelet rows provide an adjustable fastening, with a visible zipper detail alongside the laces.\n\nSculpted sole sidewall: Diagonal fins and a raised heel section give the sole a distinctive shape. The original bottom photograph shows the actual tread layout.\n\nCollar and heel details: The low-top opening has a textured lining surface, while a rear pull loop helps grip the shoe when putting it on.\n\nColour-size assortment: Ivory/Navy and Black are listed in EU39-44. Send quantities, packing preference and destination for a wholesale quotation.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
